license: CC-BY-4.0
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-02-26"
abstract: >-
  A normalized and data-quality enhanced derivative of the
  Ukrainian public-sector open dataset "Відомості про
  транспортні засоби та їх власників", published by the
  Ministry of Internal Affairs of Ukraine on data.gov.ua.
  This edition provides encoding normalization, schema
  stabilization, deduplication, and Parquet snapshots for
  reproducible analytical use.
keywords:
  - open-data
  - ukraine
  - vehicle-registry
  - data-quality
  - parquet
  - normalization
